<section id="about" class="tropi-about-banner">
  <div class="about-banner-shell">

    <div class="about-banner-copy">
      <div class="about-pill">
        🌴 Sobre Nosotros
      </div>

      <h2>
        <span class="teal">Bienestar</span>
        <span class="yellow">con sabor</span>
        <span class="pink">tropical</span>
      </h2>

      <p>
        TropiOasis nació de algo bien simple: compartir con otras personas lo que a mí me funcionó y acercar a más personas a un estilo de vida saludable de una manera sencilla, deliciosa y sostenible.
      </p>

      <p>
        La marca surge de descubrir que cuidar la salud no tiene que sentirse como una obligación ni implicar sacrificar el sabor. Lo que comenzó como un interés por incorporar opciones más naturales y nutritivas en la rutina diaria se transformó en una pasión al experimentar cómo pequeños cambios en los hábitos pueden generar grandes beneficios en el bienestar, la energía y la calidad de vida.
      </p>

      <p>
        Cada jugo cold-pressed y wellness shot está elaborado con frutas y vegetales reales, sin azúcares añadidos ni ingredientes artificiales, preservando lo mejor de cada ingrediente para ofrecer una alternativa fresca y nutritiva.
      </p>

      <div class="about-mini-note">
        <div class="note-icon">🌿</div>
        <div>
          <strong>Porque sentirse bien también puede saber bien.</strong>
          <span>Fresco, natural y hecho con propósito.</span>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="about-banner-visual">
      <div class="image-blob">
        <img
          src="{{ 'about-tropical-bottles.png' | asset_url }}"
          alt="Jugos tropicales TropiOasis"
          loading="lazy"
        >
      </div>

      <div class="about-stat-row">
        <div class="about-stat teal-card">
          <div class="stat-icon">🍉</div>
          <strong>20+</strong>
          <span>Ingredientes frescos</span>
          <p>Frutas, vegetales y superfoods seleccionados.</p>
        </div>

        <div class="about-stat pink-card">
          <div class="stat-icon">🧃</div>
          <strong>Cold</strong>
          <span>Pressed wellness</span>
          <p>Prensado en frío para conservar sabor y nutrientes.</p>
        </div>

        <div class="about-stat orange-card">
          <div class="stat-icon">🚫</div>
          <strong>0</strong>
          <span>Azúcares añadidos</span>
          <p>Sin ingredientes artificiales ni sabores falsos.</p>
        </div>

        <div class="about-stat green-card">
          <div class="stat-icon">🌿</div>
          <strong>100%</strong>
          <span>Propósito real</span>
          <p>Bienestar sencillo, delicioso y sostenible.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>

  </div>

  <div class="about-tagline">
    Fresco · Tropical · Funcional
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .tropi-about-banner {
    width: 100vw;
    margin-left: calc(50% - 50vw);
    margin-right: calc(50% - 50vw);
    position: relative;
    overflow: hidden;
    padding: 105px 6vw 80px;
    background:
      radial-gradient(circle at 0% 0%, rgba(255,220,80,.28) 0 220px, transparent 235px),
      radial-gradient(circle at 100% 12%, rgba(255,184,0,.35) 0 260px, transparent 275px),
      linear-gradient(135deg,#fffaf0 0%,#fff8ed 58%,#ecfff4 100%);
    font-family: 'Nunito', sans-serif;
    box-sizing: border-box;
  }

  .about-banner-shell {
    max-width: 1550px;
    margin: 0 auto;
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: .88fr 1.12fr;
    gap: 52px;
    align-items: center;
    position: relative;
    z-index: 3;
  }

  .about-pill {
    display: inline-flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    padding: 12px 24px;
    border-radius: 999px;
    background: #ec0057;
    color: #fff;
    font-size: 13px;
    font-weight: 900;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    box-shadow: 0 14px 30px rgba(236,0,87,.22);
    margin-bottom: 24px;
  }

  .about-banner-copy h2 {
    margin: 0;
    font-size: clamp(62px, 7vw, 118px);
    line-height: .82;
    letter-spacing: -4px;
    font-weight: 900;
    text-transform: uppercase;
  }

  .about-banner-copy h2 span {
    display: block;
  }

  .about-banner-copy .teal {
    color: #00a7b7;
    text-shadow: 0 8px 0 rgba(0,167,183,.08);
  }

  .about-banner-copy .yellow {
    color: #ffb800;
  }

  .about-banner-copy .pink {
    color: #ec0057;
    text-transform: lowercase;
    font-style: italic;
    letter-spacing: -3px;
  }

  .about-banner-copy p {
    max-width: 650px;
    margin: 30px 0 0;
    color: #07112f;
    font-size: 20px;
    line-height: 1.48;
    font-weight: 850;
  }

  .about-mini-note {
    margin-top: 34px;
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 18px;
    max-width: 570px;
  }

  .note-icon {
    width: 58px;
    height: 58px;
    min-width: 58px;
    border-radius: 50%;
    display: grid;
    place-items: center;
    background: #fff;
    border: 2px solid #00a7b7;
    color: #00a7b7;
    font-size: 24px;
    box-shadow: 0 16px 30px rgba(0,0,0,.08);
  }

  .about-mini-note strong {
    display: block;
    color: #008c9c;
    font-size: 19px;
    font-weight: 900;
  }

  .about-mini-note span {
    display: block;
    color: #07112f;
    font-size: 17px;
    font-weight: 850;
  }

  .about-banner-visual {
    position: relative;
    min-height: 650px;
  }

  .image-blob {
    width: 100%;
    height: 500px;
    border-radius: 46% 54% 18% 82% / 44% 31% 69% 56%;
    overflow: hidden;
    background:
      radial-gradient(circle at 40% 20%, rgba(255,255,255,.45), transparent 260px),
      linear-gradient(135deg,rgba(255,184,0,.7),rgba(255,122,0,.45),rgba(0,167,183,.18));
    box-shadow: 0 30px 70px rgba(0,0,0,.13);
    position: relative;
  }

  .image-blob::before {
    content: "";
    position: absolute;
    inset: 0;
    background:
      linear-gradient(135deg,rgba(255,184,0,.18),transparent 45%),
      radial-gradient(circle at 80% 10%, rgba(255,255,255,.42), transparent 180px);
    z-index: 1;
    pointer-events: none;
  }

  .image-blob img {
    width: 112%;
    height: 112%;
    object-fit: cover;
    object-position: center;
    display: block;
    position: absolute;
    left: -5%;
    top: -4%;
  }

  .about-stat-row {
    position: absolute;
    left: 0;
    right: 0;
    bottom: 15px;
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(4,minmax(0,1fr));
    gap: 18px;
    z-index: 5;
  }

  .about-stat {
    min-height: 210px;
    border-radius: 28px;
    background: rgba(255,255,255,.92);
    padding: 24px 20px;
    box-shadow: 0 24px 50px rgba(0,0,0,.12);
    border: 1px solid rgba(0,0,0,.06);
    backdrop-filter: blur(14px);
    box-sizing: border-box;
  }

  .stat-icon {
    width: 54px;
    height: 54px;
    border-radius: 50%;
    display: grid;
    place-items: center;
    color: #fff;
    font-size: 23px;
    margin-bottom: 22px;
  }

  .teal-card .stat-icon { background: #00a7b7; }
  .pink-card .stat-icon { background: #ec0057; }
  .orange-card .stat-icon { background: #ff7a00; }
  .green-card .stat-icon { background: #59b52c; }

  .about-stat strong {
    display: block;
    font-size: 38px;
    line-height: 1;
    font-weight: 900;
    margin-bottom: 8px;
  }

  .teal-card strong { color: #00a7b7; }
  .pink-card strong { color: #ec0057; }
  .orange-card strong { color: #ff7a00; }
  .green-card strong { color: #59b52c; }

  .about-stat span {
    display: block;
    color: #07112f;
    font-size: 15px;
    line-height: 1.15;
    font-weight: 900;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    margin-bottom: 18px;
  }

  .about-stat p {
    margin: 0;
    color: #3f4856;
    font-size: 14px;
    line-height: 1.35;
    font-weight: 750;
  }

  .about-tagline {
    margin: 55px auto 0;
    max-width: max-content;
    padding: 14px 28px;
    border-radius: 999px;
    background: linear-gradient(90deg,#00a7b7,#25bfb1,#9ad44b);
    color: #fff;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    letter-spacing: 7px;
    font-size: 13px;
    font-weight: 900;
    position: relative;
    z-index: 4;
    text-align: center;
  }

  @media (max-width: 1200px) {
    .about-banner-shell {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
      gap: 46px;
    }

    .about-banner-copy {
      text-align: center;
    }

    .about-banner-copy p,
    .about-mini-note {
      margin-left: auto;
      margin-right: auto;
    }

    .about-banner-visual {
      min-height: 720px;
    }
  }

  @media (max-width: 950px) {
    .tropi-about-banner {
      padding: 85px 28px 80px;
    }

    .about-banner-copy h2 {
      font-size: clamp(54px, 10vw, 78px);
      letter-spacing: -2.5px;
    }

    .about-banner-copy p {
      font-size: 18px;
    }

    .about-stat-row {
      grid-template-columns: repeat(2, minmax(0, 1fr));
      position: relative;
      bottom: auto;
      margin-top: 24px;
    }

    .about-banner-visual {
      min-height: auto;
    }

    .image-blob {
      height: 430px;
    }

    .about-stat {
      min-height: auto;
    }

    .about-tagline {
      letter-spacing: 4px;
      font-size: 12px;
    }
  }

  @media (max-width: 650px) {
    .tropi-about-banner {
      padding: 72px 18px 70px;
    }

    .about-banner-shell {
      gap: 36px;
    }

    .about-pill {
      font-size: 12px;
      padding: 10px 18px;
    }

    .about-banner-copy h2 {
      font-size: clamp(42px, 13vw, 58px);
      line-height: .88;
      letter-spacing: -2px;
    }

    .about-banner-copy .pink {
      letter-spacing: -1.5px;
    }

    .about-banner-copy p {
      font-size: 16px;
      line-height: 1.5;
      margin-top: 22px;
    }

    .about-mini-note {
      align-items: flex-start;
      text-align: left;
      gap: 14px;
    }

    .note-icon {
      width: 50px;
      height: 50px;
      min-width: 50px;
      font-size: 21px;
    }

    .about-mini-note strong {
      font-size: 16px;
    }

    .about-mini-note span {
      font-size: 14px;
    }

    .image-blob {
      height: 340px;
      border-radius: 34px;
    }

    .image-blob img {
      width: 108%;
      height: 108%;
      left: -4%;
      top: -3%;
    }

    .about-stat-row {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
      gap: 16px;
    }

    .about-stat {
      border-radius: 22px;
      padding: 20px;
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: auto 1fr;
      column-gap: 16px;
      align-items: center;
    }

    .stat-icon {
      grid-row: span 3;
      margin-bottom: 0;
    }

    .about-stat strong {
      font-size: 30px;
    }

    .about-stat span {
      margin-bottom: 8px;
      font-size: 13px;
    }

    .about-stat p {
      font-size: 13px;
    }

    .about-tagline {
      max-width: 100%;
      letter-spacing: 2px;
      font-size: 11px;
      padding: 12px 18px;
      line-height: 1.4;
    }
  }

  @media (max-width: 420px) {
    .tropi-about-banner {
      padding: 62px 14px 64px;
    }

    .about-banner-copy h2 {
      font-size: 40px;
    }

    .about-pill {
      width: 100%;
      box-sizing: border-box;
    }

    .image-blob {
      height: 290px;
    }

    .about-stat {
      padding: 18px;
    }

    .stat-icon {
      width: 46px;
      height: 46px;
      font-size: 20px;
    }

    .about-stat strong {
      font-size: 27px;
    }
  }
</style>

{% schema %}
{
  "name": "TropiOasis About",
  "settings": [],
  "presets": [
    {
      "name": "TropiOasis About"
    }
  ]
}
{% endschema %}